&lt;p&gt;Orchard Robotics makes small autonomous platforms that scout fruit orchards for disease and frost damage. Growers see what our robots find through a web dashboard, and that dashboard is where you come in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will work on&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build features in our React and TypeScript dashboard: map views of orchard blocks, alert timelines and report exports.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Extend the Node.js (Fastify) API and PostgreSQL schema that serve robot telemetry to the dashboard.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Write tests, review pull requests and pair with our two senior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Now and then, help the field team debug a robot's data upload from the other side of the world.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You must have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1-2 years of professional experience with React and TypeScript.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience building REST APIs in Node.js.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of SQL.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus points&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Leaflet, Mapbox or another web mapping library.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;PostGIS or time-series data.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Any hardware or IoT tinkering.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Details&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote-first, with core team hours 10:00-16:00 UTC. Salary EUR 30,000-40,000 per year; we hire contractors outside the EU. Our job board is embedded on our own site, so you will apply through the Orchard Robotics careers page.&lt;/p&gt;
